The registry-first sample tests/registry/fi.jsonl contains addresses and coordinates from the
Built Environment Information System Ryhti of the Finnish Environment Institute (Suomen
ympäristökeskus, Syke), dataset "Rakennetun ympäristön tietojärjestelmän rakennusten
osoitetiedot", WFS layer ryhti_building:open_address, downloaded on 2026-10-28. Source: Syke Ryhti
(Lähde: Syke Ryhti). Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Its building addresses created before Ryhti come
from the Population Information System of the Digital and Population Data Services Agency (DVV).
Dataset: https://avoindata.suomi.fi/data/fi/dataset/rakennetun-ympariston-tietojarjestelman-rakennusten-osoitetiedot
Municipality and region names: Source: Statistics Finland, classifications "Kunnat 2026" and
"Kuntien ja maakuntien 2026 välinen luokitusavain", CC BY 4.0
(https://data.stat.fi/api/classifications/v2/).
Changes: one row per address, joined with those names by tests/registry/ryhti-csv.sql; queries
were constructed from the register's fields, not by Syke. Per-case file checksums and retrieval
dates are recorded in the corpus; docs/evaluation/registry/fi.md records the upstream checksums.
